@startuml
!include skin.iuml

actor Developer as u
participant "Composer\n(React UI in renderer)" as c
participant "Agent host\n(cursor-agent-host)" as h
participant "Cursor cloud\n(api2.cursor.sh)" as api
participant "Agent exec\n(cursor-agent-exec)" as x
participant "Shell pty / files" as t
u -> c : prompt, Enter
c -> h : start turn (mode, model, context)
h -> api : stream turn
api --> c : thinking, tool calls
api -> x : run tool (terminal, edit)
x -> t : command / write file
t --> x : output, exit code
x --> api : result
api --> c : answer; turn done
c --> u : Undo / Keep / Review bar
note over h, x : TO VERIFY: process routing is read from extension\nmanifests (activation events, descriptions), not traced at runtime.
@enduml